/*!
    \module MemberSectionAnchorsModule
    \title Member Section Anchors Module
    \brief Tests unique anchors on a class page.
*/

/*!
    \class MemberSectionAnchors
    \inmodule MemberSectionAnchorsModule
    \brief A class with repeated section titles.

    \section1 Options

    The class options.

    \section1 Heading Target
    \target Heading Target

    A target sharing the section heading's location.

    \target Before Heading
    \section1 Before Heading

    A target preceding its section heading.

    \section1 Separate Heading

    A distinct section with a target elsewhere in its body.

    \target Separate Heading
    The separate \l{Separate Heading} target must not reuse the heading's id.
*/

/*!
    \fn void MemberSectionAnchors::first()
    \constraints

    Constraints for the first member.
*/

/*!
    \fn void MemberSectionAnchors::second()
    \constraints

    Constraints for the second member.
*/

/*!
    \fn void MemberSectionAnchors::options()
    Describes the options.
*/
